  "user_request_original": "Perform one bounded TMM thickness optimization for an exactly 8-layer planar stack. Use the fixed material sequence from the incident side: ZnSe / ZnS / ZnSe / ZnS / ZnSe / ZnS / ZnSe / ZnS. Optimize only the physical thickness of each finite layer within the user-declared bounds. Do not optimize material identity or layer count in this route. Optimize an 8-layer planar dielectric stack on Ge substrate with material sequence Air|ZnSe|ZnS|ZnSe|ZnS|ZnSe|ZnS|ZnSe|ZnS|Ge. Initialize thicknesses at [429.3, 71.1, 69.6, 50.3, 674.6, 71.4, 49.2, 548.5] nm. Apply bounded optimization with ±1.5% uniform perturbation around each seed value. Use derivative-based local optimizer with line-search. Evaluate under normal-incidence unpolarized illumination. Compute mean transmittance in 8000-11000 nm passband (maximize) and 3000-5000 nm stopband (minimize). Total layer count fixed at 8. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 8000-11000 nm, 3000-5000 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 8000-11000 nm band; Low transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: High transmittance in 3000-5000 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Total layer count not exceeding 16.",
